Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a younger year, when all our shadows disappeared\N♪ 曾几何时年少轻狂，当所有阴霾尽消散 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The animals inside came out to play\N♪ 内心的狂野生灵也开始尽情狂欢 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Went face to face with all our fears\N♪ 直面所有恐惧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Learned our lessons through the tears\N♪ 在泪水中领悟人生课题 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Made memories we knew would never fade\N♪ 留下我们深知永不褪色的回忆 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One day my father, he told me\N♪ 父亲曾对我说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, don't let it slip away\N♪ 孩子，切莫任时光随意流逝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He took me in his arms, I heard him say\N♪ 拥我入怀，我听见他说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get older\N♪ 当岁月催你老去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wild heart will live for younger days\N♪ 狂野的心仍为青春跳动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of me if ever you're afraid\N♪ 若恐惧来袭，想想爸爸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He said one day you'll leave this world behind\N♪ 他说人最终都会永远离开 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So live a life you will remember\N♪ 要活出自己值得铭记的一生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My father told me when I was just a child\N♪ 父亲和我说的时候我还是个小孩子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the nights that never die\N♪ 这是我和父亲间永不消逝的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My father told me\N♪ 父亲如是说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My father told me when I was just a child\N♪ 父亲和我说的时候我还是个小孩子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the nights that never die\N♪ 这是我和父亲间永不消逝的夜晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When thunder clouds start pouring down\N♪ 当雷云倾盆而泻 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Light a fire they can't put out\N♪ 点燃永不熄灭之火 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Carve your name into those shining stars\N♪ 将名字刻进璀璨星辰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He said go venture far beyond the shores\N♪ 他说扬帆远航，跨越海岸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forsake this life of yours\N♪ 莫辜负此生年华 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll guide you home no matter where you are\N♪ 无论何处我必指引归途 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One day my father, he told me\N♪ 父亲曾对我说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, don't let it slip away\N♪ 孩子，切莫任时光随意流逝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was just a kid, I heard him say\N♪ 年少时听闻此言 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get older\N♪ 当岁月催你老去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wild heart will live for younger days\N♪ 狂野的心仍为青春跳动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of me if ever you're afraid\N♪ 若恐惧来袭，想想爸爸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He said one day you'll leave this world behind\N♪ 他说人最终都会永远离开 ♪
